 "script": "What does four hundred and ninety kilometres an hour do to a tyre? That's one hundred and thirty six metres every second. It spins the tyre about four thousand one hundred times a minute, with roughly five thousand three hundred g. So Michelin reinforced the Bugatti's record tyres, tested them on a rig built for Space Shuttle tyres, and X-rayed every single one. Even a tiny flaw is dangerous. Would you ride it? Yes or no?",
